{
 "wire": "seams-wire/0.3-draft",
 "about": "Paper-money payments. Allocation mirrors the shipped compiler (declared-split+single-passthrough-v0), including its two normative worked examples. Execution is simulated. Semantics checked against zephyr/routing.py at 537d90f: the parent's standing term splits the direct leg paid to the parent's contributor.",
